    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 12 · CRM Sync\nEnable with `settings.crm.enabled=true`. Uses HubSpot private-app token.\nSet `settings.crm.custom_properties=true` after creating the `roofradar_*` contact properties in HubSpot.\nCalled fire-and-forget from 10, 24B — a CRM outage never blocks a customer.",
        "width": 520,
